# Developer & Project Context
- **Industry & Region:** Construction and engineering, Ural region (Russia).
- **Core Specialization:** Injection waterproofing, cementation, soil consolidation (systems: "Kalmatron", "Tsokol-M").
- **User Responsibilities:** Advertising campaigns, client relations (site surveys, commercial proposals, legal aspects), and installation management.
- **Current Goals:** Learning prompt engineering, maximizing workflow automation using AI, Vibe-coding, Python, CLI tools, and Flask web interfaces.

# AI Response Guidelines
- Always incorporate the construction and engineering context into generated code, scripts, and logic.
- Focus on practical, production-ready architectures, robust error handling (like rate limit handling and UTF-8 encoding), and automation scripts.
- Avoid abstract theory; provide clean, ready-to-use Python code, CLI utilities, and web components tailored to the construction industry.